namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamLayerEffects {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamLayerStyleTypes.h#DreamLayerEffects
    src   "A whole layer style. The effects that can be there more than once are arrays, drawn in order: a later one over an earlier\none. From the bottom up a styled layer is drawn: drop shadows, the outer glow, the layer itself (at FillOpacity), the\npattern overlay, gradient overlays, colour overlays, the satin, the inner glow, inner shadows, strokes, the bevel and\nemboss. The drop shadows and the outer glow lie behind the layer; everything from the overlays up lies on it, where it\nhas alpha, and blends with it by its own mode."
    text  "一个完整的图层样式。可存在多个的效果为数组，按顺序绘制：后一个绘制在前一个\n之上。带样式的图层自下而上绘制：投影、外发光、图层本身（位于 FillOpacity，即填充不透明度）、\n图案叠加、渐变叠加、颜色叠加、光泽、内发光、内阴影、描边、斜面和\n浮雕。投影和外发光位于图层之后；从叠加往上的一切都位于图层之上，即其\n有 alpha 的位置，并按各自的模式与图层混合。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayerEffects:FillOpacity {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamLayerStyleTypes.h#DreamLayerEffects:FillOpacity
    src   "The layer's own pixels' opacity; its effects keep theirs."
    text  "图层本身的像素透明度；其效果保持各自的透明度。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayerEffects:GlobalLightAngle {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamLayerStyleTypes.h#DreamLayerEffects:GlobalLightAngle
